<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia to tender A$300 mln 2000 TAB bond.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia to tender A$300 mln 2000 TAB bond.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury will offer A$300 million of October 2000 Treasury adjustable rate bonds (TABs) at a tender on Thursday, the Reserve Bank of Australia said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bank said bids would be received until 12.45 pm. (0145 GMT) on Thursday and results would be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0300 GMT). Settlement date is February 17.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
